<title>CHINA: More than 20,000 foreigners working in Shanghai.</title>
<headline>More than 20,000 foreigners working in Shanghai.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>More than 20,000 foreigners, including people from Hong Kong, Taiwan and Macau, now work in Shanghai, an official from the city's Bureau of Labour said on Monday.</p>
<p>Most of the foreigners, largely from Europe, North America, Japan and Southeast Asia, work in the city's 4,000 foreign companies and 2,000 joint ventures, the official said, but gave no further details.</p>
</text>
